      "coefficients": [
        1.0,
        0.6,
        0.15,
        0.02
      ],
      "rationale": "Greedy packing measures coexisting neighbor alternatives, and the cover-minus-pack term makes disagreement between structural summaries affect ranking. Rejection-frontier anchoring and top-three reconstruction revisit regions associated with the observed negative and zero proposals. Diversification changes live search behavior after stagnation; all summary computation is local and charged, and actual feasible reward determines credit."
    },
