      "rationale": "This composition ranks inclusion together with the structure of surviving compatible contacts. Lazy conditional evaluation uses the degree branch above 24 residual nodes, so packing and cover are evaluated only on a small residual inside the 48-node patch. Larger rejection-frontier repairs and subsequent improving swaps test schedule-level consequences; stagnation switches the active operator rather than spending indefinitely on feature fit."
