      "rationale": "Second-ring mass divided by exact neighbor-to-second-ring edge count represents escape structure; repair progress changes its balance against immediate reward as the residual contracts. The TRAIN ILS comparison motivates testing wider perturbations without validating this particular design. Twelve-contact destruction, two-hop expansion and top-three reconstruction provide a distinct search mechanism, while diversification and the per-trial CPU cap limit repeated stagnation."
